  "notes": "Two real HTTP round trips chained: `latest.release` from the manifest (\"26.2\") is looked up by exact `id` match in the manifest's own `versions` array to find that version's per-version metadata URL, which is then fetched separately to read `downloads.server.url` -- the manifest itself never carries the server jar URL directly. `build` is always the literal string \"release\" (ServerJarProviders.swift:374), never a real build number, since Mojang's API has no concept of one for a Vanilla release.",
